{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40481","headline":"送乞雨禅师临遇南游 · 曹松","name":"送乞雨禅师临遇南游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"活得枯樵耕者知，巡方又欲向天涯。\n珠穿闽国菩提子，杖把灵峰榔栗枝。\n春藓任封降虎石，夜雷从傍养龙池。\n生缘在地南浮去，自此孤云不可期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40481.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40481","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}